@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram
hide footbox
actor User
participant System

User -> System : Searches for EcoPoints\n(by location or category)
System -> System: Validates search parameters

alt Parameters valid : True
    System -> System : Fetches matching EcoPoints
    System --> User : returns success & display list

else Parameters valid : False
    System --> User : return failure
end

@enduml